ANIMATABLE bit 38, so the stroke's are 39 and 40. Main draws a run under an
axis-aligned scale as glyph-page TEX_QUADs (119297b3, 41dc68df) instead of
a GLYPH_RUN of unscaled cells; GLYPH_STROKE places unscaled cells, so a
STROKED run keeps the GLYPH_RUN path under a scale and its outline and fill
stay one size — a stroked run does not scale its glyphs, as no run did
before main. Main's layout cache culls a whole run by its cells' bounds;
for a stroked run the bounds widen by the stroke, which reaches past them.
